# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4357
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"But the XScreenSaver managing display \"%.25s\"\n"
"is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Since they are different users, they won't be reading/writing\n"
"the same ~/.xscreensaver file, so %s isn't\n"
"going to work right.\n"
"\n"
"You should either re-run %s as \"%s\", or re-run\n"
"xscreensaver as \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Restart the XScreenSaver daemon now?\n"
msgstr ""
"%s kører som bruger\"%s\"på vært\"%s\".\n"
"Men XScreenSaver-styringsskærmen \"%.25s\"\n"
"kører som bruger\"%s\"på vært\"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Da de er forskellige brugere, vil de ikke læse/skrive\n"
"den samme ~/.xscreensaver-fil, så %s er det ikke\n"
"vil arbejde rigtigt.\n"
"\n"
"Du bør enten køre igen %s som \"%s\", eller kør igen\n"
"xscreensaver som \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Genstart XScreenSaver-dæmonen nu?\n"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4381
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"But the XScreenSaver managing display \"%s\"\n"
"is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"If those two machines don't share a file system (that is,\n"
"if they don't see the same ~%s/.xscreensaver file) then\n"
"%s won't work right.\n"
"\n"
"Restart the daemon on \"%s\" as \"%s\" now?\n"
msgstr ""
"%s kører som bruger\"%s\"på vært\"%s\".\n"
"Men XScreenSaver-styringsskærmen \"%s\"\n"
"kører som bruger\"%s\"på vært\"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Hvis disse to maskiner ikke deler et filsystem (dvs.\n"
"hvis de ikke ser det samme ~%s/.xscreensaver-fil) derefter\n"
"%s vil ikke fungere rigtigt.\n"
"\n"
"Genstart dæmonen på \"%s\"som\"%s\"nu?\n"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4402
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This is %s version %s.\n"
"But the XScreenSaver managing display \"%s\"\n"
"is version %s.  This could cause problems.\n"
"\n"
"Restart the XScreenSaver daemon now?\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette er %s version %s.\n"
"Men XScreenSaver-styringsskærmen \"%s\"\n"
"er version %s.  Dette kan give problemer.\n"
"\n"
"Genstart XScreenSaver-dæmonen nu?\n"

