# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"A real-time recreation of Eric Graham's 1987 Amiga \"Juggler\" demo: a GLSL\n"
"port of his recursive ray tracer. The robot, the balls, the checkerboard\n"
"floor and the mirror reflections are all generated and raytraced "
"procedurally.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"En genskabelse i realtid af Eric Grahams 1987 Amiga \"Juggler\"-demo: en "
"GLSL\n"
"port af hans rekursive ray tracer. Robotten, boldene, skakternet\n"
"gulv- og spejlrefleksioner er alle genereret og strålesporet "
"proceduremæssigt.\n"
"\n"
"Skrevet af Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "

