msgid ""
"\n"
"This screen saver was removed from the XScreenSaver distribution as of\n"
"version 4.22.\n"
"\n"
"A cellular automaton that is really a two-dimensional Turing machine:\n"
"as the heads (\"ants\") walk along the screen, they change pixel\n"
"values in their path.  Then, as they pass over changed pixels, their\n"
"behavior is influenced.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Written by David Bagley; 1997.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Denne pauseskærm blev fjernet fra XScreenSaver-distributionen pr\n"
"version 4.22.\n"
"\n"
"En cellulær automat, der virkelig er en todimensionel Turing-maskine:\n"
"når hovederne (\"myrerne\") går langs skærmen, skifter de pixel\n"
"værdier på deres vej.  Så, når de passerer over ændrede pixels, vil deres\n"
"adfærd påvirkes.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Skrevet af David Bagley; 1997.\n"
"  "

