#: ../hacks/config/epicycle.xml.h:1
msgid "Epicycle"
msgstr "Epicykel"

#: ../hacks/config/epicycle.xml.h:12
msgid "Harmonics"
msgstr "Harmoniske"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/epicycle.xml.h:14
msgid ""
"\n"
"A pre-heliocentric model of planetary motion.\n"
"\n"
"This draws the path traced out by a point on the edge of a\n"
"circle.  That circle rotates around a point on the rim of another\n"
"circle, and so on, several times.\n"
"\n"
"The geometry of epicycles was perfected by Hipparchus of Rhodes at some "
"time\n"
"around 125 B.C., 185 years after the birth of Aristarchus of Samos, the\n"
"inventor of the heliocentric universe model.  Hipparchus applied epicycles "
"to\n"
"the Sun and the Moon.  Ptolemy of Alexandria went on to apply them to what "
"was\n"
"then the known universe, at around 150 A.D.  Copernicus went on to apply "
"them\n"
"to the heliocentric model at the beginning of the sixteenth century.  "
"Johannes\n"
"Kepler discovered that the planets actually move in elliptical orbits in "
"about\n"
"1602.  The inverse-square law of gravity was suggested by Boulliau in 1645.\n"
"Isaac Newton's Principia Mathematica was published in 1687, and proved that\n"
"Kepler's laws derived from Newtonian gravitation.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deferent_and_epicycle\n"
"\n"
"Written by James Youngman; 1998.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"En præ-heliocentrisk model af planetarisk bevægelse.\n"
"\n"
"Dette tegner stien sporet ud af et punkt på kanten af en\n"
"cirkel.  Den cirkel drejer rundt om et punkt på kanten af et andet\n"
"cirkel, og så videre, flere gange.\n"
"\n"
"Epicyklernes geometri blev perfektioneret af Hipparchus fra Rhodos på et "
"tidspunkt\n"
"omkring 125 f.Kr., 185 år efter fødslen af Aristarchus fra Samos,\n"
"opfinder af den heliocentriske universmodel.  Hipparchus anvendte epicykler "
"til\n"
"solen og månen.  Ptolemæus af Alexandria fortsatte med at anvende dem på "
"det, der var\n"
"derefter fortsatte det kendte univers omkring år 150 e.Kr. Copernicus med at "
"anvende dem\n"
"til den heliocentriske model i begyndelsen af det sekstende århundrede.  "
"Johannes\n"
"Kepler opdagede, at planeterne faktisk bevæger sig i elliptiske baner i ca\n"
"1602. Den omvendte kvadratiske tyngdelov blev foreslået af Boulliau i 1645.\n"
"Isaac Newtons Principia Mathematica blev udgivet i 1687 og beviste det\n"
"Keplers love stammer fra Newtonsk gravitation.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deferent_and_epicycle\n"
"\n"
"Skrevet af James Youngman; 1998.\n"
"  "

