#: ../hacks/config/esper.xml.h:1
msgid "Esper"
msgstr "Esper"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/esper.xml.h:10
msgid ""
"\n"
"\"Enhance 224 to 176. Pull out track right. Center in pull back.  Pull\n"
"back. Wait a minute. Go right. Stop. Enhance 57 19. Track 45 left.\n"
"Gimme a hardcopy right there.\"\n"
"\n"
"The Esper Machine was a voice-controlled forensic device used by LAPD\n"
"in 2019, as documented in the 1982 film, Blade Runner.  It was capable\n"
"of enhancing photographs to an extreme degree, including reconstructing\n"
"different viewpoints within the space from the reflections on various\n"
"objects in the photograph.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2017.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\"Forbedre 224 til 176. Træk sporet til højre. Midter i træk tilbage. Træk\n"
"tilbage. Vent et øjeblik. Gå til højre. Stop. Enhance 57 19. Spor 45 "
"venstre.\n"
"Giv mig en papirkopi lige der.\"\n"
"\n"
"Esper Machine var en stemmestyret retsmedicinsk enhed brugt af LAPD\n"
"i 2019, som dokumenteret i filmen Blade Runner fra 1982.  Det var kapabelt\n"
"at forbedre fotografier i ekstrem grad, herunder rekonstruktion\n"
"forskellige synspunkter i rummet fra refleksioner over forskellige\n"
"objekter på fotografiet.\n"
"\n"
"Skrevet af Jamie Zawinski; 2017.\n"
"  "

