# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/kallisti.xml.h:18
msgid ""
"\n"
"The golden apple of discord.\n"
"\n"
"Greek goddess Eris was not invited to a wedding; her retort was to toss in "
"a\n"
"golden apple, inscribed: \"to the fairest\".  Hera, Athena and Aphrodite\n"
"squabbled over it; Zeus noped out, telling Paris of Troy to decide. They "
"all\n"
"cheated, but Aphrodite won by letting Paris abduct and marry Helen of "
"Sparta.\n"
"The Greeks objected to this, leading to the Trojan War.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to launch a thousand ships? Because this is how you launch a\n"
"thousand ships.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Judgement_of_Paris\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski and Jared Williams; 2024.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Uenighedens gyldne æble.\n"
"\n"
"Den græske gudinde Eris var ikke inviteret til et bryllup; hendes replik var "
"at smide en\n"
"guldæble, påskrevet: \"til de smukkeste\".  Hera, Athena og Afrodite\n"
"skændtes over det; Zeus sagde nej og fortalte Paris af Troja at beslutte "
"sig. De alle sammen\n"
"snydt, men Afrodite vandt ved at lade Paris bortføre og gifte sig med Helen "
"af Sparta.\n"
"Grækerne protesterede mod dette, hvilket førte til den trojanske krig.\n"
"\n"
"tusinde skibe.Vil du søsætte tusinde skibe? For det er sådan, du starter en\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Judgement_of_Paris\n"
"\n"
"Skrevet af Jamie Zawinski og Jared Williams; 2024.\n"
"  "

