# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/quasicrystal.xml.h:9
msgid "Contrast"
msgstr "Kontrast"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/quasicrystal.xml.h:14
msgid ""
"\n"
"A quasicrystal is a structure that is ordered but aperiodic.\n"
"\n"
"Two-dimensional quasicrystals can be generated by adding a set of\n"
"planes where x is the sine of y.  Different complex aperiodic plane\n"
"tilings are produced depending on the period, position, and rotation\n"
"of the component planes, and whether the rotation of the planes is\n"
"evenly distributed around the circle (the \"symmetry\" option, above)\n"
"or random.\n"
"\n"
"See also the \"RD-Bomb\", \"CWaves\" and \"Penrose\" screen savers.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quasicrystal\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2013.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"En kvasikrystal er en struktur, der er ordnet, men aperiodisk.\n"
"\n"
"flisebelægninger produceres afhængigt af periode, position og rotation\n"
"af komponentplanerne, og om drejningen af planerne er\n"
"Todimensionelle kvasikrystaller kan genereres ved at tilføje et sæt af\n"
"jævnt fordelt rundt om cirklen (muligheden \"symmetri\" ovenfor)\n"
"planer hvor x er sinus af y.  eller tilfældigt.Forskellige komplekse "
"aperiodiske plan\n"
"\n"
"Se også pauseskærmene \"RD-Bomb\", \"CWaves\" og \"Penrose\".\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quasicrystal\n"
"\n"
"Skrevet af Jamie Zawinski; 2013.\n"
"  "

#: ../hacks/config/queens.xml.h:1
msgid "Queens"
msgstr "Dronninger"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/queens.xml.h:7
msgid ""
"\n"
"The N-Queens problem: how to place N queens on an NxN chessboard\n"
"such that no queen can attack a sister?\n"
"\n"
"See also the \"Endgame\" screen saver.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eight_queens_puzzle\n"
"\n"
"Written by Blair Tennessy and Jamie Zawinski; 2002.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"N-Queens-problemet: hvordan placeres N-dronninger på et NxN-skakbræt\n"
"sådan at ingen dronning kan angribe en søster?\n"
